WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.587 --> 00:00:04.880
- Hello, I'm Louie King.

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:06.131
- King of Broadway.

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:07.382
- Action.

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:11.136
- The story of "Little Voice" is about
a young woman named Bess King,

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:14.014
and she's stepping into
young adulthood.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:16.391
Her brother has moved
into a group home.

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:18.644
- Louie is Bess' older brother.

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.896
- Everything you need
to know about Broadway.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:22.105
- He's all into showbiz.

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:23.649
- Kevin is uniquely abled.

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:26.401
We went on a nation-wide
search for Kevin.

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:29.863
There is something unforgettable,
something so precious about him.

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:31.865
He's just a really special actor.

00:00:31.949 --> 00:00:34.243
- I believe that my career
as an autistic person

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:36.078
can show what everybody can do.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:39.581
Working in theatre requires
a certain theatrical flare.

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:41.583
Oh, my God!
It's Nicholas Christopher!

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:44.753
Will you sign my playbill?

00:00:44.837 --> 00:00:47.297
- Kevin embraced learning about
theatre in New York.

00:00:47.381 --> 00:00:49.967
It was great to watch him
dig into all of that.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.260
- Whoo!
- Whoo!

00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:54.054
- To find someone who could not
just fit the character as written,

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:56.390
but elevate it.
And we finally found Kevin.

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:58.225
- These were our favorite days
on set were being

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:00.978
any of the scenes where we were
working with Louie or his buddies.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.938
Had an incredible
experience with Kevin.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:04.982
- Kevin is an incredibly
committed actor.

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:05.858
- This is big news.

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:08.068
- Every scene we ever did
was so much fun.

00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:10.237
- Here are your tickets.
Enjoy the show.

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:14.032
One unexpected moment
can change your whole future.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:20.247
♪ I'm coming back to you ♪

